              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu nyũmba ya Isilaeli makamanya ninyie Yeova Ngai woo, kuma mũthenya ũsu na kũendeea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na i mbaĩ ikamanya nyũmba ya Isilaeli nĩyaendie yĩ ndave nũndũ wa ũthũku wayo; nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmambĩtanĩsye, na namavitha ũthyũ wakwa; kwondũ wa ũu namanenganie kw’okonĩ kwa amaitha moo, na onthe mavalũkw’a na ũvyũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
